{"dog":{"age_group":"adult","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","breed_primary":"Domestic Short Hair Cross","description_text":"My foster writes:\nMazie's world changed forever when her owner passed away, and she was brought to ACC. Since then, she has to rebuild her world from scratch and learn how to trust again. Could you be the person to give Mazie the second chance she deserves? She is looking for a loving, permanent home where she can finally feel safe again.\n\nMazie struggled to adjust to shelter life, so she came to stay with me at the end of April. While she still doesn't trust me enough for direct interaction, she quietly watches me from a distance in open spaces, and that distance has been getting smaller and smaller over time. Mazie is a brave girl who is trying in her own way.\n\nAlthough Mazie hasn't shown her playful side when I'm in the room, her camera footage tells another story. When she feels safe and alone, she reveals an energetic, entertaining personality. One of her favorite things is sitting by the window (even when I'm nearby) soaking up the sunshine, fresh breeze, and the world outside.\n\nMazie is making progress every day. What she needs now is someone patient and compassionate enough to let her continue healing at her own pace.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=2%2C15&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=7&searchType=4&animalid=200153","id":"e08c863088877791a6c52fc1001409e8","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/e163028c821f4b9198b889e7e24d0835-1779479094-1779479101-png/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/528788ee9d064d98949c56b4368bf487-1779465686-1779465686-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/997e1cb55fd9472fb78e506203ee1d51-1779465686-1779465686-jpeg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.co